  "releaseNotes": "10.3.0 (breaking): schemas follow Jakar.Json 11's member rules: [JsonKey], [JsonSkip], [JsonOptIn], [JsonOverflow], [JsonCreator] and ReadOnlyMembers; System.Text.Json attributes and contexts no longer affect [JsonModel] schemas. Built against Jakar.Json 10.3.0. 10.2.0: built against Jakar.Json 10.2.0, whose writers take a ref TWriter; 10.1.0 calls the removed IBufferWriter overloads and throws MissingMethodException with Jakar.Json 10.2.0. 10.1.0: initial release.",
